<title>USA: Starcraft sees $700,000 Q1 pretax charge.</title>
<headline>Starcraft sees $700,000 Q1 pretax charge.</headline>
<dateline>GOSHEN, Ind. 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Starcraft Corp, a manufacturer of van and truck conversions, said it estimates it will take a $700,000 pretax restructuring charge in the first quarter of fiscal 1997.</p>
<p>The company's first fiscal quarter ends December 29.</p>
<p>The company plans to consolidate its Imperial manufacturing operations into Starcraft's Goshen, Ind. manufacturing complex in December 1996.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
